   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Grass-roots organisations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CODACOP works with the Indigenous Guard (IG) of the Nasa communities in the north of the department of Cauca to develop leadership and planning skills. The Guard organises the community in case of attack, and deter aggression by non-violent resistance. They also work with Nasa women (through the ACIN) to develop their leadership and political role in community organisations and with the Laurita sisters in support of their work with indigenous communities in Urab&#xE1;, Antioque&#xF1;o and Sierra del Perij&#xE1;. CODOCOP also focusses on linking up grassroots communities and communities seeking to be neutral in the civil conflict and networking.</narrative>
  </description>
